    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about a trip",
     "texto": [
      "Hyttetur means «trip to a cabin». Sove means «to sleep» and overnatte means «to spend the night» at a place.",
      "Ute means «outside» and inne «inside». These expressions are used to talk about where you sleep and about an outdoor trip."
     ],
